@* تفاصيل دفعة أرصدة افتتاحية + العكس (بعد الترحيل فقط، عبر آلية العكس الموجودة) *@
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResources> Loc

<MudDialog>
    <DialogContent>
        <MudGrid>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["OpeningBalanceFiscalYear"]: <b>@Batch.FiscalYear</b></MudText>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["Status"]: <b>@Batch.StatusNameAr</b></MudText>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["EntryDate"]: <b>@Batch.EntryDate.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")</b></MudText>
            </MudItem>
            <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["JournalEntryNumber"]: <b>@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Batch.EntryNumber) ? "—" : Batch.EntryNumber)</b></MudText>
            </MudItem>
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Batch.Reference))
            {
                <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["ReferenceDocument"]: <b>@Batch.Reference</b></MudText>
                </MudItem>
            }
            @if (Batch.PostedAt is not null)
            {
                <MudItem xs="12" sm="6">
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["OpeningBalancePostedBy"]: <b>@Batch.PostedBy — @Batch.PostedAt?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")</b></MudText>
                </MudItem>
            }
            @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Batch.Description))
            {
                <MudItem xs="12">
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["DescriptionStatement"]: @Batch.Description</MudText>
                </MudItem>
            }
        </MudGrid>

        <MudTable Items="Batch.Lines" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">
            <HeaderContent>
                <MudTh>@Loc["Account"]</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Loc["OpeningBalanceDetailKind"]</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Loc["OpeningBalanceDetailValue"]</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Loc["Debit"]</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Loc["Credit"]</MudTh>
            </HeaderContent>
            <RowTemplate>
                <MudTd>@context.AccountCode - @context.AccountNameAr</MudTd>
                <MudTd>@context.DetailKindAr</MudTd>
                <MudTd>
                    @if (context.CustomerId is not null)
                    {
                        <span>@context.CustomerCode - @context.CustomerNameAr</span>
                    }
                    else if (context.SupplierId is not null)
                    {
                        <span>@context.SupplierCode - @context.SupplierNameAr</span>
                    }
                    else if (context.ItemId is not null)
                    {
                        <span>
                            @context.ItemCode - @context.ItemNameAr
                            @if (context.Quantity is not null)
                            {
                                <text> · @Loc["OpeningBalanceQuantityDetail"]: @context.Quantity?.ToString("N4")</text>
                            }
                            @if (context.UnitCost is not null)
                            {
                                <text> · @Loc["OpeningBalanceUnitCostDetail"]: @context.UnitCost?.ToString("N4")</text>
                            }
                        </span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <span class="muted-text">—</span>
                    }
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd>@context.DebitAmount.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
                <MudTd>@context.CreditAmount.ToString("N2")</MudTd>
            </RowTemplate>
        </MudTable>

        <MudPaper Elevation="1" Class="pa-3 mt-2">
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["DebitTotal"]: @Batch.TotalDebit.ToString("N2")</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">@Loc["CreditTotal"]: @Batch.TotalCredit.ToString("N2")</MudText>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Color="@(Batch.TotalDebit == Batch.TotalCredit ? Color.Success : Color.Error)">
                @Loc["Difference"]: @Math.Abs(Batch.TotalDebit - Batch.TotalCredit).ToString("N2")
            </MudText>
        </MudPaper>

        @if (Batch.ReversalOfBatchId is not null)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Info" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">@Loc["OpeningBalanceReversalOf"]</MudAlert>
        }
        @if (Batch.ReversedByBatchId is not null)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Warning" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">@Loc["OpeningBalanceReversedNotice"]</MudAlert>
        }
        @if (_error is not null)
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" Class="mt-3">@_error</MudAlert>
        }

        @if (_isPosted)
        {
            <MudPaper Elevation="1" Class="pa-3 mt-3">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2" Class="mb-1">@Loc["OpeningBalanceReverseAction"]</MudText>
                <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="mb-2 muted-text">@Loc["OpeningBalanceReadOnly"]</MudText>
                <MudDatePicker @bind-Date="_reverseDate" Label="@Loc["OpeningBalanceReverseDate"]"
                               Variant="Variant.Outlined" T="DateTime?" AutoClose="true" />
            </MudPaper>
        }
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        @if (_isPosted)
        {
            <MudButton OnClick="ReverseAsync" Variant="Variant.Filled" Color="Color.Warning"
                       StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Undo" Disabled="@_busy">
                @Loc["OpeningBalanceReverseAction"]
            </MudButton>
        }
        <MudButton OnClick="Close" Color="Color.Default">@Loc["Cancel"]</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [CascadingParameter] private IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; } = default!;

    [Parameter] public OpeningBalanceBatchDto Batch { get; set; } = default!;

    [Inject] private IOpeningBalanceService OpeningBalanceService { get; set; } = default!;
    [Inject] private AuthenticationStateProvider AuthState { get; set; } = default!;

    private bool _busy;
    private string? _error;
    private DateTime? _reverseDate = DateTime.Today;

    /// <summary>يُسمح بالعكس فقط لدفعة مُرحَّلة لم تُعكس بعد (لا تعديل/حذف بعد الترحيل).</summary>
    private bool _isPosted => Batch.Status == (int)OpeningBalanceBatchStatus.Posted && Batch.ReversedByBatchId is null;

    private void Close() => MudDialog.Close(DialogResult.Ok(false));

    private async Task<string> CurrentUserIdAsync()
    {
        var auth = await AuthState.GetAuthenticationStateAsync();
        return auth.User.FindFirst(System.Security.Claims.ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier)?.Value
               ?? auth.User.Identity?.Name ?? "system";
    }

    private async Task ReverseAsync()
    {
        if (_busy) return;

        if (_reverseDate is null || _reverseDate.Value.Year != Batch.FiscalYear)
        {
            _error = Loc["OpeningBalanceDateOutsideYear"];
            return;
        }

        _error = null;
        _busy = true;
        try
        {
            await OpeningBalanceService.ReverseAsync(Batch.Id, _reverseDate.Value, await CurrentUserIdAsync());
            MudDialog.Close(DialogResult.Ok(true));
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            _error = ErrorLocalizer.Resolve(Loc, ex);
        }
        finally
        {
            _busy = false;
        }
    }
}
